473392025_570326435364252_1671269543686935979_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QEh_fiNNeNUQ7kNvwG0kPx6&_nc_oc=AdrsYBm7wUxvGNQ5fIey-s_xKEFz-FNEo8A6qASbQqEapEedrTLGBWskZjyupUKBtQ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOCizJld7G4UNCoG1PsXpZAwgS4SUH3IAgQbLo0VkKE3g&oe=6AE1F617"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "646026574804312", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392010_646026578137645_9023846448384584760_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RVLBiT-qKF8Q7kNvwEmdAcr&_nc_oc=AdqgM-fcVh5zxENg27n28B3Rpz6ZJc_iGk0IMjoFXHDjpQVDzleM1x1-L_cILADNazI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMvvwffLfVLrS5L2XbKyaGcG-nNOyfRyVAn92e1Xe2UvQ&oe=6AE2032A"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1400275601117059", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391924_1400275604450392_6111570253860139230_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fFFQqtQw5F8Q7kNvwGg8onZ&_nc_oc=AdqWYi1dxTUlyBpjeF7IoVgijgnTrJZNwkKU_XB_CVKSyYzypFMaVmp-gYHYXeV6PC8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOx7GZW1sEVQY2uFX6UmlkSbrgRLdO0LKzZ0bEpnPSKwA&oe=6AE1E60D"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "2455081078173099", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391888_2455081081506432_2090184349680392773_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v8mXk7KyydkQ7kNvwGeIDng&_nc_oc=AdqeyHeO9CGbT4ruXEV3O1EiZAt63ZK1xuzJADg0JRVImfm4S1_PBbeqdlY_Ja-Lt3o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOiof36Hr16SLB1Yt6SjZXpXM5FCfCUy6hK3EfjV7Rawg&oe=6AE1F1CD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "528339819997704", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392309_528339823331037_367341527598948289_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sRJelVFeBdwQ7kNvwG3S-zl&_nc_oc=Adp_h41YGV7JP02EHpU70Y_WVq4GA9VKfD3TGQHGwE-SetSYjh1EiRiG6rDBYicuk1A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMKaBKgKd1XCUB4WQgqTAUcUeYG9YpaRz6rVTzEs75eiA&oe=6AE20FD2"}, "display_name": "Punch Beat Arena", "keywords": ["Game", "Rhythm", "Music", "Fitness", "Boxing"], "long_description": "# **\ud83e\udd4a Punch Beat Arena \ud83c\udfb6**\n\nStep into Punch Beat Arena, a high-energy VR boxing game that blends rhythm-based gameplay with fierce action. Get ready to fight to the beat as you throw punches, dodge, and weave to the music in a world where your reflexes and rhythm define your success.\n\n{1070244414940312}\n\n# **Key Features:**\n\n- Rhythm-Driven Boxing: Strike, block, and move in sync with the music. Every action you take is influenced by the beat, offering an exhilarating challenge that combines skill and timing.\n\n- Wide Selection of Tracks & Arenas: Pick from a diverse array of tracks across various genres. Each song brings its own set of challenges and arenas, tailored for both beginners and advanced players.\n\n- Fitness Meets Fun: Punching to the beat isn't just about fun\u2014it's a full-body workout! Sharpen your reflexes and burn calories while enjoying the excitement of the game.\n\n- Immersive Experience: With stunning visuals and high-quality sound design, every round feels like you're truly in the ring, feeling the music pump you up as you fight.\n\n{1030845768901015}\n\nGear up, find your rhythm, and punch your way to victory in Punch Beat Arena, where every beat is a new challenge to conquer!", "short_description": "\ud83e\udd4a Punch Beat Arena \ud83c\udfb6\n\nExperience the ultimate VR rhythm boxing game where every punch and move is synced to the beat. Fight, dodge, and punch to a variety of tracks in immersive arenas. A fun, full-body workout that combines music, action, and fitness in one exciting experience!\nLet's Play !!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tolgakalaycioglu.com/totosgame/PrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Totos